  "implemented": [
    "Stable 128-bit type/field IDs, canonical scalar cells and independent SHA-256 compatibility fingerprints; native schema validation rejects duplicate keys, invalid defaults, nonfinite values and unresolved entity references.",
    "Authored document v2 imports, entity custom components, guarded transactions, undo/redo, durable receipts, filtered queries and retained retired type IDs. Legacy worlds remain v1 until schema use.",
    "Generated C# Query/Get/TryGet/Set/IsAlive use native-owned storage. Writes stage until Tick returns; sparse first-touch journals join whole-batch rollback. Component revision is independent of global gameplay revision.",
    "Compatible CoreCLR reload retains payloads without pinning retired contexts; component shape/default changes reject. Version-2 snapshots restore fixed membership under exact schema/module bindings; legacy version-1 fixture still passes.",
    "Native AOT artifacts carry verified generated component metadata, and project inspection/export validate component declarations against the authored world.",
    "Inspector manifest import, typed authoring and paused live drafts share native authority with agents. Dirty and stale drafts guard session transitions and saves. Scaffolding creates stable IDs for handwritten C# components."
  ],
